      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I thought you were going to be different from me,” she said",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1071
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I didn’t know you had standards,” I said. It incensed me, in a way I haven’t gotten angry for years, that she could hav",
