          "pos": 1131
        }
      ],
      "words": 47
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Oh, don’t give me that. You’ve been making your own choices since you were a toddler. You dressed yourself every mornin",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1360
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But I think I registered whatever was going on as Ruthie Problems, which I had learned from a young age to keep separate",
